    "text": "A projectile is fired with the velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>o</mn></mrow></msup></math> with horizontal. At top of its trajectory, it explodes into three fragments of equal mass. The first fragment retraces the path, second moves vertically upward with speed <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. The speed of the third fragment (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) is\r\r<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 382px; top: 14px;\">\r<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r</div>\r"
  },
